# The desktop app parks a full git worktree per Code session under
# .claude/worktrees/. They are other checkouts of this repo, not source, and
# they are not tracked — so CI never sees them while `pnpm format:check` ran
# over every file in every one of them and failed on code nobody was editing.
# Measured 2026-09-20: 13 warnings, all from one stale worktree. The same
# blind spot crashed `eslint .` outright the same day (see eslint.config.mjs).
# A local gate that fails for reasons CI cannot reproduce stops being read.
.claude
